{"game":"WarioWare: Twisted!","source":"custom","apworld":"wario_ware_twisted.apworld","world_version":"1.1.1","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"included_stages","name":"Included Stages","kind":"set","doc":"Which stages will be added in the location pool.\nCan be left empty.\n\nValid stages:\n    - \"Wario\"\n    - \"Mona\"\n    - \"Jimmy\"\n    - \"Kat & Ana\"\n    - \"Dribble & Spitz\"\n    - \"Dr. Crygor\"\n    - \"Orbulon\"\n    - \"9-Volt\"\n    - \"Wario-Man\"\n    - \"Jimmy's Folks\"\n    - \"WarioWatch\"\n    - \"WarioWatch 2\"\n    - \"Skyscraper\"\n    - \"Tower\"\n    - \"Mansion\"","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":["Wario","Mona","Jimmy","Kat & Ana","Dribble & Spitz","Dr. Crygor","Orbulon","9-Volt","Wario-Man","Jimmy's Folks","WarioWatch","WarioWatch 2","Skyscraper","Tower","Mansion"],"valid_keys":["9-Volt","Dr. Crygor","Dribble & Spitz","Jimmy","Jimmy's Folks","Kat & Ana","Mansion","Mona","Orbulon","Skyscraper","Tower","Wario","Wario-Man","WarioWatch","WarioWatch 2"],"doc_fr":"Quelles étapes seront ajoutées dans la piscine de localisation.\nPeut être laissé vide.\n\nÉtapes valides:\n    - \"Wario\"\n    - \"Mona\"\n    - \"Jimmy\"\n    - \"Kat & Ana\"\n    - \"Dribble & Spitz\"\n    - Dr Crygor\n    - \"Orbulon\"\n    - \"9 volts\"\n    - \"Wario-Man\"\n    - \"Les gens de Jimmy\"\n    - \"WarioWatch\"\n    - \"WarioWatch 2\"\n    - \"Skyscraper\"\n    - \"Tower\"\n    - \"Homme\""},{"key":"starting_stage","name":"Starting Stage Pool","kind":"set","doc":"Which of the following stages will be chosen as a potential initial stage.\nThe stage has to be in the pool in order to be chosen.\nCan be left empty.\n\nValid stages:\n    - \"Wario\"\n    - \"Mona\"\n    - \"Jimmy\"\n    - \"Kat & Ana\"\n    - \"Dribble & Spitz\"\n    - \"Dr. Crygor\"\n    - \"Orbulon\"\n    - \"9-Volt\"\n    - \"Wario-Man\"\n    - \"Jimmy's Folks\"\n    - \"WarioWatch\"\n    - \"WarioWatch 2\"\n    - \"Skyscraper\"\n    - \"Tower\"\n    - \"Mansion\"","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":["Wario","Mona","Jimmy","Kat & Ana","Dribble & Spitz","Dr. Crygor","Orbulon","9-Volt","Wario-Man","Jimmy's Folks","WarioWatch","WarioWatch 2","Skyscraper","Tower","Mansion"],"valid_keys":["9-Volt","Dr. Crygor","Dribble & Spitz","Jimmy","Jimmy's Folks","Kat & Ana","Mansion","Mona","Orbulon","Skyscraper","Tower","Wario","Wario-Man","WarioWatch","WarioWatch 2"],"doc_fr":"Laquelle des étapes suivantes sera choisie comme étape initiale potentielle.\nLa scène doit être dans la piscine pour être choisie.\nPeut être laissé vide.\n\nÉtapes valides:\n    - \"Wario\"\n    - \"Mona\"\n    - \"Jimmy\"\n    - \"Kat & Ana\"\n    - \"Dribble & Spitz\"\n    - Dr Crygor\n    - \"Orbulon\"\n    - \"9 volts\"\n    - \"Wario-Man\"\n    - \"Les gens de Jimmy\"\n    - \"WarioWatch\"\n    - \"WarioWatch 2\"\n    - \"Skyscraper\"\n    - \"Tower\"\n    - \"Homme\""},{"key":"microgame_unlock","name":"Microgame Unlock","kind":"choice","doc":"How are microgames unlocked.\n* Bundles: Character bundles are added into the pool which unlocks the corresponding set of games\n* Individual: Unlocks for individual microgames are added into the pool","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"bundles","label":"Bundles","id":0},{"value":"individual","label":"Individual","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"bundles","doc_fr":"Comment les micro-jeux sont-ils déverrouillés ?\n* Bundles: Des paquets de caractères sont ajoutés dans le pool qui déverrouille l'ensemble de jeux correspondant\n* Individual: Des déverrouillages pour des microjeux individuels sont ajoutés à la piscine"},{"key":"crowns","name":"Crowns","